## Subscription / Licensing Limitation

Some practical activities may require an active Azure subscription and specific Microsoft security licenses.

Where those requirements are unavailable, the lab is documented as a theoretical or configuration exercise.

No fabricated evidence is included.

---

## Evidence Principle

> Evidence must represent an actual configuration, test, or result from the lab environment.
